{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>山姆會員店App「全球購」近期上架始祖鳥（ARC'TERYX）、加拿大鵝（CANADA GOOSE）等多款服飾，不少商品的售價比官方旗艦店便宜數百至數千元（人民幣，下同），其中CANADA GOOSE的EXPEDITION派克大衣價差更高達近5000元，一度引發搶購潮，多款商品迅速售罄斷貨。</p><figure><img alt=\"CANADA GOOSE多款商品「暫時缺貨」。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196513228566302720219840.jpeg/X9UQlH6lL6_L2UX6wb1MJ87UBLgHRSmiB5eulQeXrpU\"/><figcaption>CANADA GOOSE多款商品「暫時缺貨」。</figcaption></figure><p>繼Coach、Lululemon、Tommy Hilfiger等國際品牌後，山姆首度在內地跨境電商渠道引入高級戶外與服飾品牌ARC'TERYX及CANADA GOOSE。商品頁面列明「進口」、「保稅倉直發」，售價介乎999元至10999元不等，標價普遍比品牌官網及品牌天貓官方旗艦店便宜數百至數千元。目前，CANADA GOOSE多款商品顯示「暫時缺貨」。</p><p>在山姆「全球購」上，ARC'TERYX的BETA SL JACKET售價3999元/件，ALPHA SV JACKET售價6499元/件，比品牌天貓官方旗艦店的同款產品便宜1400至1700元。</p><figure><img alt=\"在山姆「全球購」上，ARC'TERYX的BETA SL JACKET售價3999元/件，ALPHA SV JACKET售價6499元/件。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196512184104914944350429.jpeg/7S46ZwF1nbY6HNb-Ih6OhsqvfB9kkS6OdHpKxXR6SsU\"/><figcaption>在山姆「全球購」上，ARC'TERYX的BETA SL JACKET售價3999元/件，ALPHA SV JACKET售價6499元/件。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"在品牌天貓官方旗艦店，BETA SL JACKET售價5400元/件，ALPHA SV JACKET售價8200元/件。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196512648913489920145698.jpeg/YBIAlM9qpVbsIvzoExuxylq0t3TuRf7RLMe7fSzHu30\"/><figcaption>在品牌天貓官方旗艦店，BETA SL JACKET售價5400元/件，ALPHA SV JACKET售價8200元/件。</figcaption></figure><p>至於CANADA GOOSE的EXPEDITION派克大衣，品牌天貓官方旗艦店標價16300元，「雙11」平台補貼價為15800元，而山姆售價為10999元，相差近5000元。</p><figure><img alt=\"CANADA GOOSE的EXPEDITION派克大衣，山姆售價為10999元。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196513688417210368506128.jpeg/fR4l3dt-ThyIEYPLvh7iGhGkYwOwUx-PBlffEgZX3xI\"/><figcaption>CANADA GOOSE的EXPEDITION派克大衣，山姆售價為10999元。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"CANADA GOOSE的EXPEDITION派克大衣，品牌天貓官方旗艦店標價16300元，「雙11」平台補貼價為15800元。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196513691005227008532740.jpeg/fZe80vKIpTWDEyvsMe9h3yr7phAOHX0936reHN-q3hw\"/><figcaption>CANADA GOOSE的EXPEDITION派克大衣，品牌天貓官方旗艦店標價16300元，「雙11」平台補貼價為15800元。</figcaption></figure><p>值得注意的是，山姆明確標示ARC'TERYX及CANADA GOOSE均為全球購商品，不適用於7天無理由退貨規定，買家下單前須自行確認尺碼及版型，承擔售後差異。兩大品牌僅限於山姆小程序或App線上下單直郵，山姆門店並無售賣，多款商品列明「限購」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:56.954345+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":897,"images":5,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T10:00:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:49.730915+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:57.863459+00:00","content_hash":"bc74c73580a866054011045ef41350910cb20c06573c5a439750386bd7a7d469","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}